laxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe there is only one God who eternally exists in three Persons: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit (Matt 28:19).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"አንድ ዘላለማዊ እና መለኮታዊ አምላክ በሶስት አካል የተገለጠ (አብ ውልድ እና መንፈስ ቅዱስ) እንደሆነ እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":3}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe Jesus Christ is God, born of the virgin Mary, lived a sinless life, performed miracles, died on the cross for our sins, bodily resurrected, ascended, and will return with power and glory (John 1:1; Matt 1:19,25; Heb 4:15; Heb 9:15-22; 1Cor 15:1-8; Acts 1:9-11; Heb 9:27-28).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"እየሱስ ክርስቶስ አምላክ፣ የእግዚአብሔር ልጅ እንደሆነ፤ ፍጹም አምላክ፣ ፍጹም ሰው መሆኑን፣ ምንም ኃጢያት የሌለበት መሆኑን፤ በመስቀል ላይ ተሰቅሎ ሞቶ ተነስቶ እዳችንን እንደከፈለ፣ ከሞት እንደተነሣ፣ በደሙ ኃጤያታችንን ሁሉ እንዳስወገደ፤ ወደሰማይ እንዳረገ፣ በክብር ተመልሶ እንደሚመጣ እናምናለን።\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":4}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe accepting Jesus Christ as Lord and personal Savior and corresponding renewal by the Holy Spirit are the only path to salvation (John 3:16; John 5:24; Titus 3:3-7).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"በኃጢአት ምክንያት ከዘላለም ሕይዎት የተለዩ ሠዎችን ሊያድን የሚችለው በክርስቶስ ኢየሱስ አዳኝነት ማመንና በመንፈስ ቅዱስ የሆነ መታደስ እንደሆነ እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":5}],\"$L1c\"]}],\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\"]}]]}]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1a\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@27\"}]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe in the present ministry of the Holy Spirit, who lives within and guides Christians so they are enabled to live godly lives (John 14:14-16; John 16:5-16; Eph 1:13-14).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"በመንፈስ ቅዱስ መሪነት፣ አስተማሪነት፣ ኃይል ሰጪነት እና አገልግሎት እናምናለን።\"}]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":6}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe in eternal life (Matt 25:31-46; 1 Thess 4:13).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"በዘላለማዊ ሕይወት እናምናለን።\"}]]}]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":7}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe in the spiritual unity of believers in our Lord Jesus Christ — that all believers are members of His body, the church (Phil 2:1-4).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"በክርስቶስ ያመኑ አማኞች ሁሉ የክርስቶስ አካል የሆነችው ቤተክርስቲያን አካል፣ አንድ ቤተሰብ እንደሆንን እናምናለን።\"}]]}]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":8}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe God's design for sexual intimacy is to be expressed only within the context of marriage between one man and one woman. Marriage is exclusively the union between one man and one woman (Gen 2:24; Matt 19:5-6; Mark 10:6-9; Rom 1:26-27; 1Cor 6:9).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"ጋብቻ በአንድ ሴት እና አንድ ወንድ መካከል ብቻ መሆኑን እና ግብረስጋ ግንኙነት ከተጋቡ ቡኋላ በእነሱ መካከል መሆኑን እናምናለን።\"}]]}]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":9}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe God created all human beings in His image; therefore human life is sacred from conception to its natural end. Every person should be treated with love, dignity, and respect (Psalm 139:1-24; Isa 49:1; Jer 22:37-39; Rom 12:20-21; Gal 6:10).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"ሰው ሁሉ በእግዚአብሔር አምሳል የተፈጠረ ስለሆነ እኩል ፍቀር ሊሰጠው እንደሚገባው መንፈሳዊም ስጋዊም ፍላጎቱ ሊከበርለት እንደሚገባው እናምናለን።\"}]]}]]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"div\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":10}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe that salvation is a gift from God to man. Man can never make up for his sin by self-improvement or good works — only by trusting in Jesus Christ can man be saved. Eternal life begins at the moment one receives Jesus Christ by faith (Rom 6:23; Eph 2:8-9; John 14:6; Titus 3:5; Gal 3:26; Rom 5:1).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"ከኃጢያት እና ከዘላለም ሞት ፍርድ መዳን ሰው ፈጽሞ በመልካም ስራው በራሱ ጥረት ሊያገኘው እንደማይችል ኢየሱስን በማመን ብቻ የሚገኝ የእግዚአብሔር ነጻ ስጦታ መሆኑን እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":11}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe the Holy Spirit is present in the world to make people aware of their need for Jesus Christ. He lives in every Christian from the moment of salvation.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"መንፈስ ቅዱስ ሰዎችን ሁሉ በኃጥያታቸው በመወቅስ እና ወደ እውነት እና ንሰኃ እንደሚመራ እናምናለን፤ እየሱስ ክርስቶስን አምነው የተቀበሉት ሁሉ ውስጥ እንደሚኖር እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":12}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe water baptism is a biblical command and demonstration of our love and obedience to Christ. Baptism by immersion symbolizes the death, burial, and resurrection of Jesus Christ and is the public declaration that we have accepted Jesus as our personal Savior (Col 2:12; Acts 2:41; Eph 2:8-9; Matt 28:19-20).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"ጥምቀት መጽሐፍ ቅዱሳዊ ትዛዝ እንደሆነ ሁሉም እየሱስን አምኖ የተቀበለ፣ የክርስቶስን ሞትና ትንሣኤ መተባበር እንዳለበት ያመነ የሚወስደው መሆኑን እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"div\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":13}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe in adult baptism — it is provided for those who receive Jesus Christ as their personal Savior.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"ሰዎች በኃጥያታቸው ንሰኃ ገብተው እየሱስን አምነው ተቀብለው ለመከተል ከወሰኑ ቡሓላ በማጥመቅ እናምናለን\"}]]}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"flex gap-6 pb-8 border-b border-gray-100 last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-church-blue text-white text-sm font-bold font-display flex items-center justify-center\",\"children\":14}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#3a2a20] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2\",\"children\":\"We believe in Holy Communion: the Lord's Supper is an ordinance given to all believers by Jesus Christ to remember His sacrifice and symbolizes the new covenant. The bread and wine (or juice) are symbols of Christ's broken body and shed blood. Communion is not a means of salvation; it is a testimony of a believer's faith in the atoning work of the cross (Matt 26:26-30; Mark 14:22-26; Luke 22:19-20).\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#7a6a60] text-sm leading-relaxed italic\",\"children\":\"የጌታ እራት ለአማኞች ኢየሱስ የከፈለልንን መከራ ለማስታወስ የተሰጠ ትዛዝ ሲሆን፣ የአዲሱ ኪዳን ምልክት ነው። ኅብስቱ እና ጽዋው የክርስቶስ አካልና ደም ምሳሌዎች ናቸው። ቁርባን ድኅነትን ለማግኘት ሳይሆን የአማኝ ሃይማኖቱን ለመመስከር የሚፈጸም ነው።\"}]]}]]}]\n18:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n28:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n1b:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"ስለ እኛ | Christ Saints' Church\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"ፍቅር፣ ተስፋ፣ ሕይወት — ክርስቶስ ቅዱሳን ቤተክርስቲያን አዲስ አበባ\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/images/logo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L28\",\"3\",{}]]\n27:null\n","/about/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n13:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3bk0cpzuomv-5.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n14:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n0:{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"relative py-40 px-6 bg-hero-gradient text-center overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(139,26,26,0.3)_0%,transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative